# Dart's `.dart_tool/`, where `dart pub get` writes `package_config.json`.
[Dart .dart_tool/]
description = regenerable: Dart tool state, rebuilt by `dart pub get` — it holds pub's `package_config.json`
kind = build-output/v1
filter {
  $d.dir.name == ".dart_tool"
  $d has package_config.json
  then $d/
}
